{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_durnar_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_durnar_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"额外训练","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_durnar_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"0dbb17682ca77061cc1de7f0e44bf82c5a4c0f25dfa0c59d6ea298a8d376d99e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"坚雷对A1小队的战斗测试"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，A1预备小队的新人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的例行训练内容，到这里就——结束了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜恭喜！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，原本你们刚来的时候练个把小时就要死要活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"看看现在，一个个还都还没喘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"说明训练效果还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，谢谢教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"米格鲁！坚雷教官发言还没结束，你怎么可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦芬，我又不是杜宾，没那么多规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"大家平时训练都很累了，这种时候就轻松一点，可以吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，越来越像杜宾了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是！——是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你看啊，腰板一挺，手往两旁一贴，视线直勾勾对着我眼睛，这不就是杜宾嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"语调么，这个就不用我说了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"真的哦，一模一样~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这也是件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"和我当兵那会不一样，罗德岛有个完整的教官团负责所有预备干员的培训，每个人都有他们的特点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我想不到的，他们就会察觉到并给你们补上一课，反之也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"这样一来，每个预备干员都能获得接近全面的训练课程，而不是让个傻大兵来想所有事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"格瑞斯、法伦、杜宾，还有其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是处理教学课程还是一起上战场，都是些值得信任的好伙计啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"加油把杜宾身上的东西都学过来好吗，我们还挺想多一个助教的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"好的教官，谢谢教官关心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，提醒我训练完以后找管理场地的人修整场地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好几次都练忘了，结果回头就被杜宾骂，唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了吗，芬，一定要提醒我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是，教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"闲聊就到此为止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"全体都有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"立——正！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"正如大家所知的那样，今天的例行训练内容结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们的训练时间还空出了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在接下来的时间里，我将和大家一起进行愉快的对抗训练！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（倒吸一口凉气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴于有几位朋友还没参与过对抗训练的课程，所以呢，我会简单讲一下训练内容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"（完了，死定了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然听上去挺花哨，但其实就是模拟实战训练，我会评估大家的作战方式，然后给出优化方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）姐姐，你看看米格鲁啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）别说话，先听教官讲完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊当然，这次和普通的对抗还是有区别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——既然你们都在，那就当一对五的训练赛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"正好也让我检查一下各位的训练成果和默契程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，大家先休息一会，放放松，吃块糖什么的，我也去做个准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"解散！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"芬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么办！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不知道啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"你们太紧张啦，又不是杜宾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"坚雷教官是不可怕啊，但，但格斗对抗训练时候的她完全是另外一回事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"坚雷教官会参加近卫、重装和先锋干员的近身对抗练习，这炎熔你是知道的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，然后嘞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道那时候坚雷教官是怎么样的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"还能......怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"她会放下盾牌提着两把剑暴锤我一个小时的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"唰唰唰像风一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前一直以为教官天天都很和善，不怎么批评人，还会请大家吃好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次格斗对抗训练结束以后才知道......坚雷教官要是开骂了比杜宾教官还狠。几轮打下来，枪都有点拿不稳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"特别是持盾的那只手，一旦拿了剑，挥下来真的像闪电那么快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我知道了，大概就是和流星姐姐在训练场里对射那种感觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，和流星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真行啊克洛丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，没过一分钟就中了五支训练箭啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"好菜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，如果不想挨打，千万，千万不可以小瞧坚雷教官啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"她可是个老兵，要不是对哥伦比亚军方有意见，现在还是在役士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她一会多带把刀来，我们就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，我问问啊，今天早上有人因为外伤去医疗部擦药水的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"每天来医疗部的人都特别多，擦伤淤青之类其实还，挺常见的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，这个很重要，帮忙想一想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上我在给病房里的人换药，没有去坐诊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"但是听苏苏洛说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"好像A4预备小队所有人早上训练结束后都去了一下外科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是坚雷教官带着去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"这有什么联系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到玫兰莎和卡缇也没能挡住教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"就算教官能一个人对付你们，但我们有五个人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"A4也有五个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那有什么，我们还是比A4要强的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧，芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊，是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"我们加油......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"加油！加油......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你们好像没什么信心嘛，真有这么可怕？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"全体都有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"列队！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看来你们都准备好了，很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，能问个问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（克洛丝！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"问吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"您为什么，多带了把训练剑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"看你这问题问的，当然是为了训练。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，刚刚休息的时候突然怀念起以前的战斗技巧，想找人试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊当然，我和大家用的东西一样，是训练用装备，没带自己改装的电刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你们最好重视点啊，别因为平时对你们和善就觉得实践也会让你们一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不想挨打，就好好应战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"训练手册上对于突发应敌的步骤之前有看过吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次对抗我会面对你们开始，之后就要把整个场地利用起来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"愣着干什么，碰到敌人不需要警戒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"警戒！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，反应不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是初战，就由你们先发起攻击吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"互相之间要注意配合，要是不当心，那就和我挨个对付你们没区别了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那就开始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"米格鲁，盯紧了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔、克洛丝，准备......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"好~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，治疗就交给你了，米格鲁压力会比较大，优先照顾她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"准备——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"放！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"慢了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"呜啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"米格鲁，把教官逼回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"在做了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"大家盯紧些。只要教官不出我们视线她没机会的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"吃我这招！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"怎——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊糟糕！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔你怎么回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"完了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞄到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"教官？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"都起来吧，我来整理一下问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔，我们本来有机会的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"但我怎么知道米格鲁会突然挡住我嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是问题，对吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是的教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（好凶！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，现在地形上没有高低起伏，后排更容易产生误伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"而且炎熔的源石技艺特性在这样的空间里施展不开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种情况下，你完全可以把技艺施展到我背后，压缩我的活动空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"在我和你的队友几乎面对面的情况下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么瞄准我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"米格鲁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"（要挨骂了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"“那个问题”，还没能克服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"比以前稳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，还不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"卡缇防御的时候特别喜欢晃动，虽然这样会产生更多破绽，但这招对她是不管用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的作战风格是求稳，但在还没能稳到抵抗干扰的时候，就要用技巧去补足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"举盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"举盾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得我刚刚是怎么干扰你的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"您格挡我的攻击，然后撞在盾上，我就被带到炎熔的源石技艺运行轨迹上去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果芬的行动够快，她完全可以在我撞上你之前把我逼退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"就像第一次克洛丝做的那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果你准备一个人接下我的撞击，你可以试试三种解决方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"一，想好反击手段，然后闪开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"这会让你的队友在某个瞬间完全暴露在敌人面前，但只要你能伺机击倒我，就可以快速回到防御姿态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"二，直接架盾冲撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"盾也是一种武器，在面对冲撞时，你也可以通过盾牌展开进攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你需要时刻注意对方，别人没撞到，自己一个踉跄冲出去，把后背和队友留给敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"三，偏转方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你之所以会被我撞到炎熔的法术前，完全是因为你的姿态和重心让我有这样的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的防御姿势是这样的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"还是后退了，但没有影响到炎熔和克洛丝的攻击路径。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，先学会这套方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"好的教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你是小队的队长，负责指挥大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，你怎么确认队友情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"靠感觉和观察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"观察？怎么观察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"用，用眼睛看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"在你回头瞥一眼的瞬间，你觉得敌人会不会抓住这个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你们小队的站位是根据基础课程教材来的吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是的教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"但，不是太严格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"战场条件那么复杂，严格执行才会出错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"在，教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要承担芬的部分职责，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"但我具体要做些什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要成为芬背后的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你、炎熔和克洛丝的站位发生较大改变，需要告知芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"周边环境的变化，特别是后方变动，你需要立刻告诉她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"在芬倒下的时候，你需要负责领导队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"好的教官，我试试看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"我错了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"我不该射芙蓉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"远程干员的专业和分工我不太懂，就不评价了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"单论团队配合，你做得还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你方便说一下自己在射击对抗训练上的表现吗，我好做个预估。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"一般是流星姐姐来当老师，唰唰唰就把我射倒了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛斯，别太随便了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"流星——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，都给我打起精神来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"这才过了几分钟啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来我们要用上训练场的障碍物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是战场，而战场上的敌人可不会对你们手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你们，或者我，能在这里多活几秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"互相加油吧，小朋友们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一小时后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，看来我没怎么退步，真是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——时间正好，那我们今天的训练就正式结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜恭喜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么不拍手了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"对......对不起教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，一会请你们吃好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"腊肠怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我那儿刚刚到了些炎国的腊肠，用特质酱料腌过，又鲜又香，可诱人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，听上去就很好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"会不会太油腻了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但在那之前，我得带你们先去一趟医疗部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你们放心，我也安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格鲁","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"原来卡缇她们不是被教官打进医疗部的啊，吓死我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那当然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"当了那么多年兵，别的不说，对付你们几个还是有法子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"轻重缓急，早就拿捏好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"交给你们的技巧，可都是实打实拿伤口和战友的命换回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"要是给我发现你们哪个不好好把诀窍记脑子里，下一次我就拿电刃和你们练。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明，明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那就出发吧，早检查完早吃东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（我好像忘了件事......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（教官要我做什么来着？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芬，酸辣的吃嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"吃，吃啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那一会的零食啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"好，谢谢教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"都下课了，还在喊教官呐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，坚雷小姐......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你来的正好，训练场是你在管理吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是的，杜宾教官，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"坚雷带的小组使用完训练场地以后一些设施和障碍物有损毁，估计是刚刚进行了高强度对抗训练。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"请帮我修整一下，晚上我带预备干员要用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"后勤干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我这就去办。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_121_lava","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_122_beagle","aliases":["米格鲁"]},{"speakerId":"char_123_fang","aliases":["芬"]},{"speakerId":"char_124_kroos","aliases":["克洛丝"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_260_durnar","aliases":["坚雷"]}]}
